Backport the upstream UTF-8/UTF-16 tag-handler separation to LAME 4.0.
Source: https://svn.code.sf.net/p/lame/svn/trunk/lame/ (retrieved 2026-11-08)
The UTF-8 field setter, declaration and export are required by the frontend fix.

